# ACL por identidade (CN do certificado = username) — menor privilégio (RT-07)
#
# Dispositivo <cn>: publica só a própria telemetria/estado e lê só os próprios comandos.
pattern write dev/%u/telemetry
pattern write dev/%u/state
pattern write dev/%u/event
pattern read  dev/%u/cmd

# Nó de borda: lê tudo dos dispositivos, publica comandos e alarmes locais.
user edge-centro
topic read dev/#
topic write dev/+/cmd
topic readwrite site/#

user edge-escola
topic read dev/#
topic write dev/+/cmd
topic readwrite site/#

user edge-ubs
topic read dev/#
topic write dev/+/cmd
topic readwrite site/#

user edge-horta
topic read dev/#
topic write dev/+/cmd
topic readwrite site/#

user edge-abrigo
topic read dev/#
topic write dev/+/cmd
topic readwrite site/#
